  IsTutorial: 1
  TutorialSteps:
  - topText: Welcome to Blobs. The goal of the game is to clear all blobs off the
      board. You can clear a Blob by merging it into another one of a different color
      as long as they are on a shared row or column.
    bottomText: Try merging the purple Blob onto the one next to it.
    startX: 0
    startY: 2
    endX: 2
    endY: 2
  - topText: "See that flag pole? That\u2019s a Flag Blob. Flag Blobs can lead to
      a win when merged, as long as there are no other Blobs on the board."
    bottomText: Flags can't initiate a merge, but any normal Blob of the same color
      that is merged with it will clear. Try it out!
    startX: 2
    startY: 2
    endX: 2
    endY: 0
